On update, send local version:

```ts
await api.put(`/surveys/${survey.serverId}`, {
  ...survey,
  clientVersion: survey.version,
});
```

On the server:

```ts
if (incoming.clientVersion < existing.version) {
  return res.status(409).json({ message: 'Conflict', serverRecord: existing });
}
