## 13) Better conflict strategy example

A simple rule:

- If `local.updatedAt > server.updatedAt`, local wins.
- Else server wins.

Pseudo:

```ts
function resolveConflict(local, server) {
  if (new Date(local.updatedAt) > new Date(server.updatedAt)) {
    return local;
  }
  return server;
}
```

