# 1) Core requirements

The app should:

1. Allow field workers to create/edit surveys offline
2. Store all survey records locally first
3. Queue changes for later sync
4. Detect connectivity changes
5. Sync queued changes to server automatically when online
6. Pull down server updates after push
7. Handle conflicts safely
8. Preserve user data even if app closes unexpectedly

