# 2) Data model

A survey record should include:

```ts
type SurveyRecord = {
  localId: string;        // UUID generated on device
  remoteId?: string;      // server ID after sync
  version: number;        // monotonically increasing for conflict detection
  status: 'draft' | 'submitted' | 'synced' | 'conflict';
  createdAt: string;
  updatedAt: string;
  payload: {
    location: { lat: number; lng: number };
    notes: string;
    measurements: Array<{
      type: string;
      value: number;
      unit: string;
    }>;
    photos?: string[];   // local file URIs or uploaded remote URLs
  };
  syncState: {
    pending: boolean;
    lastSyncedAt?: string;
    syncError?: string;
  };
};
