# 1) Core requirements

The app should support:

- Create/edit survey records offline
- Store everything locally first
- Detect online/offline status
- Queue local mutations while offline
- Sync queued changes when back online
- Pull down updates from server
- Avoid losing user work

A survey record might contain:

- id
- projectId
- plotId
- observerName
- surveyDate
- latitude
- longitude
- notes
- photos
- synced metadata

