# 6) How offline sync works

1. When user submits a survey:
   - It is saved to IndexedDB immediately
   - If online, it is also posted to the server
   - If offline, it is added to the sync queue

2. When the browser comes back online:
   - The app reads entries from the queue
   - Posts them to the server
   - Removes them from the queue
   - Reloads server data into local storage

