## 5) How it works

### Offline
- User adds survey data
- App stores it in IndexedDB
- App queues the mutation in `pending`
- Data is visible immediately in the local list

### Reconnect
- Browser fires `online`
- App calls `syncNow()`
- Pending mutations are sent to server
- Server stores them
- Client clears queue
- Client pulls any remote changes

