## 7) How it works

- When the user submits a survey, it is saved in IndexedDB immediately.
- If online, the app attempts to sync to the server.
- If offline, records stay pending locally.
- On reconnect, the `online` event triggers sync.
- The app also pulls server surveys and merges new ones.

