## Replacing mock data with real streaming data

If you have a WebSocket feed, replace the `tick()` logic with something like:

```js
const ws = new WebSocket("wss://your-feed.example.com");

ws.onmessage = (message) => {
  const update = JSON.parse(message.data);
  // Example update: { symbol: "AAPL", price: 195.12, volume: 123456 }
  const stock = data.find(d => d.symbol === update.symbol);
  if (stock) {
    stock.prevPrice = stock.price;
    stock.price = update.price;
    stock.volume = update.volume ?? stock.volume;
    render();
  }
};
```

