Below is an initial client-side implementation of an interactive stock price heatmap with:

- real-time updates via simulated streaming data
- zoom and pan interactions
- hover tooltips
- color scaling for gains/losses
- a simple layout using plain HTML/CSS/JS and SVG

You can later replace the simulated data feed with a real WebSocket/API stream.

