## 7) What’s included in the real-time collaboration

Whenever a task or column changes:
- backend updates the in-memory board
- backend emits `board:updated` to all websocket clients
- every connected browser receives the new board state instantly

That gives you multi-user synchronized boards with almost no client complexity.

