# 2) Recommended Architecture

## Core components

### A. Market Data Gateway
- Connects to exchanges/brokers
- Normalizes inbound market data
- Publishes updates into internal event bus

### B. Strategy Engine
- Consumes normalized market events
- Runs strategy logic
- Emits order intents

### C. Risk Manager
- Checks size, position limits, exposure, order rate, kill switch rules
- Approves or rejects orders before sending

### D. OMS / Order Router
- Tracks order state
- Sends orders to venues
- Handles acks, fills, rejects, cancels, replace requests

### E. Position / Portfolio Service
- Maintains positions, PnL, average price
- Updates from fills and trades

### F. Replay / Event Log
- Durable append-only log for recovery and backtesting
- Replays state after restart

### G. Monitoring / Control Plane
- Metrics, logs, health checks
- Config updates
- Kill switch

