## What this does

- Captures Ethernet frames from one interface
- Applies a filter function to decide whether to:
  - drop
  - forward to another interface
  - optionally rewrite destination MAC
- Forwards frames at line rate as much as the kernel and NIC allow
- Tracks basic counters

