# Forwarding Loop

A minimal busy-poll forwarding loop:

```c
static void forwarding_loop(uint16_t in_port, uint16_t out_port) {
    struct rte_mbuf *pkts[BURST_SIZE];

    while (1) {
        uint16_t nb_rx = rte_eth_rx_burst(in_port, 0, pkts, BURST_SIZE);
        if (nb_rx == 0)
            continue;

        struct rte_mbuf *forward[BURST_SIZE];
        uint16_t fwd_count = 0;

        for (uint16_t i = 0; i < nb_rx; i++) {
            uint16_t target = process_packet(pkts[i]);
            if (target != UINT16_MAX) {
                forward[fwd_count++] = pkts[i];
            } else {
                rte_pktmbuf_free(pkts[i]);
            }
        }

        if (fwd_count > 0) {
            uint16_t sent = rte_eth_tx_burst(out_port, 0, forward, fwd_count);
            for (uint16_t i = sent; i < fwd_count; i++) {
                rte_pktmbuf_free(forward[i]);
            }
        }
    }
}
```

