- pin threads to CPU cores
- disable unnecessary copies
- use busy polling only in controlled environments
- consider `AF_XDP` for very high performance

### Safety
This version:
- does not rewrite packets
- does not NAT
- does not spoof
- does not attempt stealth

### Limitations
- Ethernet-layer forwarding only
- no routing decisions
- no checksum recomputation if you modify payloads
- no fragmentation handling
- no VLAN-aware policy unless you add it

