## Example Exponential Moving Average

If you want a lighter filter than moving average:

```c
static float ema_filter(float sample) {
    static float ema = 0.0f;
    static bool initialized = false;
    const float alpha = 0.1f;

    if (!initialized) {
        ema = sample;
        initialized = true;
    } else {
        ema = alpha * sample + (1.0f - alpha) * ema;
    }
    return ema;
}
```

