## Example of a more robust filter
If you want a simple moving average, you can use:

```c
#define AVG_WINDOW 8

static uint16_t samples[AVG_WINDOW];
static uint8_t sample_index = 0;
static uint32_t sample_sum = 0;

static float moving_average(uint16_t input)
{
    sample_sum -= samples[sample_index];
    samples[sample_index] = input;
    sample_sum += input;

    sample_index = (sample_index + 1) % AVG_WINDOW;

    return (float)sample_sum / AVG_WINDOW;
}
```

