It includes:
- a simple stream processing path
- a high-pass-ish removal of DC bias using a moving average
- feature extraction from acceleration magnitude
- adaptive baseline tracking
- anomaly scoring with thresholding
- a fixed-size buffer, no dynamic allocation

You can run it on a microcontroller and feed it samples from an accelerometer ISR or polling loop.

