# 2) Configuration

```c
typedef struct {
    float alpha;              // EMA smoothing factor, e.g. 0.1f
    float window_size;        // number of samples in a window
    float anomaly_threshold;  // score threshold for anomaly
    float gravity_ref;        // expected accel magnitude near 1g, e.g. 9.81f
    float jerk_threshold;     // optional fast-shock detection threshold
} anomaly_config_t;
```

