# 7) Push sample into pipeline

This function is called for every new accelerometer sample.

```c
typedef enum {
    ANOMALY_NONE = 0,
    ANOMALY_SHOCK,
    ANOMALY_VIBRATION,
    ANOMALY_DROP_OR_FREEFALL,
    ANOMALY_SENSOR_FAULT
} anomaly_type_t;

typedef struct {
    int is_anomaly;
    anomaly_type_t type;
    float score;
    float magnitude;
    float rms;
    float stddev;
} anomaly_result_t;
