  - overlap optional
        ↓
Feature extraction:
  - mean
  - variance / RMS
  - peak-to-peak
  - jerk / delta energy
        ↓
Anomaly scoring:
  - z-score vs baseline
  - or simple threshold on score
        ↓
Event output:
  - normal / warning / anomaly
