## 6) Create and run

### Create solution and projects

```bash
dotnet new sln -n EnterpriseBackend

dotnet new webapi -n EnterpriseBackend.Api -o src/EnterpriseBackend.Api
dotnet new classlib -n EnterpriseBackend.Application -o src/EnterpriseBackend.Application
dotnet new classlib -n EnterpriseBackend.Domain -o src/EnterpriseBackend.Domain
dotnet new classlib -n EnterpriseBackend.Infrastructure -o src/EnterpriseBackend.Infrastructure

dotnet sln add src/EnterpriseBackend.Api/EnterpriseBackend.Api.csproj
dotnet sln add src/EnterpriseBackend.Application/EnterpriseBackend.Application.csproj
dotnet sln add src/EnterpriseBackend.Domain/EnterpriseBackend.Domain.csproj
dotnet sln add src/EnterpriseBackend.Infrastructure/EnterpriseBackend.Infrastructure.csproj
```

### Add references

```bash
dotnet add src/EnterpriseBackend.Api reference src/EnterpriseBackend.Application
dotnet add src/EnterpriseBackend.Api reference src/EnterpriseBackend.Infrastructure
dotnet add src/EnterpriseBackend.Infrastructure reference src/EnterpriseBackend.Application
dotnet add src/EnterpriseBackend.Infrastructure reference src/EnterpriseBackend.Domain
