### Run migrations and update DB

```bash
dotnet tool install --global dotnet-ef
dotnet ef migrations add InitialCreate --project src/EnterpriseBackend.Infrastructure --startup-project src/EnterpriseBackend.Api
dotnet ef database update --project src/EnterpriseBackend.Infrastructure --startup-project src/EnterpriseBackend.Api
```

### Run the API

```bash
dotnet run --project src/EnterpriseBackend.Api
```

